  "description": "Fuaran.UI.Program — the UI adapter for the domain-generic bounded program core: the UI witness (the UI tier's action union, node tree, binding store, tree-ops and client effects seen through the core's witness contract), the pre-0.6.0 names as aliases over it, and the UI transport loop (the bounded driver, its channel glue and the client runtime). Fable-clean. Released with the Fuaran.UI tier, in its version line, and built against the core's released packages (its previous package id, retired in fuaran#2022, last released 0.7.1 beside the core). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
